o + global-metadata.dat         Unity IL2CPP: strings global-metadata.dat | grep ANS- ; Managed/*.dll -> ilspycmd\n   120\t   assets/www/, cordova.js, capacitor.config  hybrid JS: grep -r in assets/www\n   121\t   assets/*.dex|*.jar|*.apk|*.zip|*.bin       dynamic code loading: unzip it, jadx it, re-run extract_answer on it\n   122\t   libjiagu/libsecexe/libDexHelper.so          packer: payload is the encrypted asset; static decrypt or give up early\n   123\t   res/xml/network_security_config.xml        NSC: aapt dump xmltree x.apk res/xml/network_security_config.xml\n   124\t   resources.arsc                   aapt dump --values resources x.apk | grep -iE 'ans-|secret|key|flag|token'\n   125\t   *.db / shared_prefs/*.xml / *.ab sqlite3 f.db .dump ; .ab: dd bs=24 skip=1 | zlib-flate -uncompress | tar x\n   126\t   res/raw/*.bks|*.p12|*.pem        keystore: password is a dex string; keytool -list -v -storepass PW\n   127\t   google-services.json / firebase  key/URL itself may be the answer\n   128\t   base.apk + split_config.*.apk / manifest.json / toc.pb / BundleConfig.pb   split/XAPK/APKS/AAB: unzip inner, recurse\n   129\t   Payload/*.app/                   iOS: plistlib Info.plist; rz-bin -zz the Mach-O\n   130\t2. Plain-anywhere scan (incl. UTF-16 the zip scan misses):\n   131\t   for f in $(unzip -Z1 x.apk); do unzip -p x.apk \"$f\" | strings -a -el | grep -H --label=\"$f\" ANS-; done\n   132\t   7z l x.apk vs unzip -l x.apk differ -> zip tricks (dup entry / trailing data): binwalk x.apk\n   133\t3. Manifest (fast): aapt dump xmltree x.apk AndroidManifest.xml | grep -E \\\n   134\t   'exported|scheme|host|autoVerify|permission|debuggable|allowBackup|usesCleartext|networkSecurity|taskAffinity|launchMode|meta-data'\n   135\t   meta-data value= is a hiding spot (huntress.mechanic lives there). droidasc getmanifest x.apk prints the XML.\n   136\t4. Dex triage: strings -a classes*.dex | grep -E 'DAY-|CODEC|ANS-|^[0-9A-F]{8,16}$' then map API hits to themes:\n   137\t   DexClassLoader/InMemoryDexClassLoader -> asset dex     SecretKeySpec/AES/Cipher/IvParameterSpec -> static key decrypt\n   138\t   loadLibrary/RegisterNatives -> .so                     java/util/Random/setSeed/currentTimeMillis -> regenerate RNG\n   139\t   MessageDigest/PBKDF2 -> hash brute                     addJavascriptInterface/loadUrl/file:///android_asset -> assets html/js\n   140\t   Binder/$Stub/Messenger/onReceive -> IPC handler        CertificatePinner/sha256/ -> pins in code or NSC\n   141\t   su/magisk/RootBeer/goldfish/frida/TracerPid -> flag sits in the gated branch: read it, never run it\n   142\t   Class.forName/getDeclaredMethod -> decode names        BuildConfig / R$string -> arsc / BuildConfig.java\n   143\t   KeyStore.getInstance(\"BKS\"|\"PKCS12\") -> res/raw keystore + password string\n   144\t5. Read code only after 1-4: droidasc findrefs x.apk string <hit>; droidasc getclass x.apk <cls>; jadx -d w/jadx x.apk\n   145\t   (add --deobf for 1-2 letter class names). Strings split across constants: rebuild order from the method body.\n   146\t   R8/decoys (D17): hint strings like \"follow b -> a and ignore field c\" name the chain; >1 ANS- candidate -> keep\n   147\t   the one appended before `proof=` in ChallengeActivity, never the first regex hit.\n   148\t   lib scanners for code-side answers (not in extract_answer): renamed_chain_scan, proof_flow_scan, dex_eval_scan,\n   149\t   reflection_scan, mapping_restore_scan, signing_block_scan, zip_structure_scan  (all lib.android, take apk path)\n   150\t6. Native, if no literal: rizin -A -qc 'iE; izz~ANS; afl' f.so ; pdf @ sym.Java_... ; xor loops -> py capstone/unicorn.\n   151\t7. Validate: candidate must fullmatch ^ANS-[0-9A-F]{16}$ (uppercase). Two sources (asset + .so) agreeing = submit.\n   152\t8. Mastery: each set can be a different day's fixture; decode every APK on its own; loop over all answer_ids (3 or 5).\n   153\t```\n   154\t\n   155\t## Readiness gaps\n   156\t\n   157\tPriority 1 = plausible within days. \"prebuild\" = pure-python extractor in `lib/android.py` style that races in\n   158\t`solve.py`. \"tool\" = install. \"note\" = doc/prompt change. Already built (prebuild-state ok, dropped from the list):\n   159\tutf16-string-pool-scan, nested-container-recurse, dex-native-split-assembly, static-key-cipher-decode,\n   160\tdecode-any-chain-peel, native-so-emulate-export, dex-string-decrypt-arrays, asset-db-prefs-backup,\n   161\tidentity-derived-key, hermes-hbc-string-table, cert-and-signing-facts, il2cpp-metadata-literals,\n   162\tjni-export-return-trace, jni-gate-bypass-input, registernatives-table, native-stack-string, multi-abi-arm-native,\n   163\tdex-native-call-args, native-gated-branch-read, dex-gated-branch-consts, webview-asset-js-scan,\n   164\tcert-pin-and-nsc-facts, puzzle-indexed-and-perm-fields, proof-flow-candidate-ranking, r8-renamed-chain-follow,\n   165\tdalvik-mini-interpreter, permutation-transposition-family, reflection-name-resolve, proguard-mapping-restore,\n   166\tapk-signing-block-payload, zip-structure-anomaly-scan, integrity-derived-key.\n   167\t\n   168\t```json\n   169\t[\n   170\t  {\"id\": \"ans-prefix-numeric-compose\", \"concept\": \"answer composed in code from an `ANS-` prefix + numeric constants (row 69)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Pure python over androguard: for every method holding const-string `ANS-`/`ANS`, collect const-wide/const ints, fill-array-data longs and int pairs in the same method and emit `ANS-` + format(v & 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF, '016X'), hi/lo int pairs (`%08X%08X`), and Long.toHexString forms (lowercase -> upper, zero-pad). Also cover `\\\"ANS-\\\" + Integer.toHexString(a) + Integer.toHexString(b)`. Return regex-valid candidates for proof_flow ranking; never submit the first one blind.\"},\n   171\t  {\"id\": \"custom-alphabet-decode\", \"concept\": \"puzzle/dex data in a custom base64/base32/base58 alphabet carried in the dex (rows 35, 36)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Obfuscation days favour shuffled alphabets. Pure python: take every dex/asset string of length 32, 58, 64 or 65 with all-unique printable chars as a candidate alphabet; translate the puzzle `data` (and other base-n-shaped strings) to the standard alphabet and decode; also reversed alphabet and alphabet as a key-schedule for a substitution cipher (map data chars through alphabet<->sorted). Keep only `^ANS-[0-9A-F]{16}$` hits. Wire into puzzle_candidates' unknown-codec branch.\"},\n   172\t  {\"id\": \"asset-cipher-dex-loader\", \"concept\": \"dynamic code loading of an ENCRYPTED asset dex (rows 42, 44; MASVS-RESILIENCE arc D15-D17)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"nested_scan handles plain or single-byte-xor dex/zip only. Extend: when the dex references DexClassLoader/InMemoryDexClassLoader/PathClassLoader or an asset is high-entropy, try repeating-key XOR, RC4, AES-ECB/CBC/GCM (pycryptodome) with keys/IVs from dex strings, byte arrays and the package name / signing-cert digest (integrity_facts), plus zlib/gzip after decrypt; accept output starting `dex\\\\n0` / `PK\\\\x03\\\\x04`, then recurse extract_answer + renamed_chain_scan + dex_eval_scan on it.\"},\n   173\t  {\"id\": \"native-init-array-decrypt\", \"concept\": \"native strings decrypted at load time by .init_array constructors (OLLVM `.datadiv_decode*`) (rows 46, 66)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"native_so_emulate covers exported functions only. Pure python: parse DT_INIT_ARRAY / .init_array with pyelftools, map the .so in unicorn (x86_64 + arm64), run each constructor with stubbed imports (return 0) and a step cap, then scan the writable .data/.bss for ANS- tokens and the strings referenced by the Java_* export. Also handle `datadiv_decode<N>` symbols by name and JNI_OnLoad run before RegisterNatives.\"},\n   174\t  {\"id\": \"worker-cue-inline\", \"concept\": \"unseen-theme routing\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"Inline the 'Recognition cues' block above into the mobile worker prompt (skills/huntress-ctf mobile skill) so an unseen container (Flutter/RN/Xamarin/asset dex) is routed in 1-2 turns; add step 2's UTF-16 scan to triage.md pre-extraction.\"},\n   175\t  {\"id\": \"identifier-collision-resolve\", \"concept\": \"names differing only by case / homoglyph / zero-width char, and overloaded R8 names (row 68)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"'Name Collapse' pun points at name collisions next. androguard: report class/field/method names whose casefold / NFKC / zero-width-stripped / confusable-skeleton forms collide, and same-name members distinguished only by descriptor. Resolve every invoke/sget by FULL descriptor (never by simple name) when following the proof= flow; feed the true target into renamed_chain_candidates. On disk (jadx/apktool on case-insensitive FS) collisions overwrite fi","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/home/testpwn/.claude/projects/-home-testpwn-huntress-2026/6ac0157f-4942-470c-97f2-0b3e1d481171/tool-results/bf6pp1wbz.txt","persistedOutputSize":36086},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TSEqFuYAazaRjhz4Wc6iEH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
