cryption helper (XOR arrays in `<clinit>`) | seen D18 (theme only: answer = asset `xor`; TT dex `EncryptedStrings.decryptByte`) |\")\nrep(\"| 36 | Puzzle codec escalation (compound, zlib, rot47, vigenere, permutation) | partly seen D1-D17 (D17 `indexed`) |\",\n    \"| 36 | Puzzle codec escalation (compound, zlib, rot47, vigenere, permutation) | partly seen D1-D18 (D17 `indexed`; D18 reused `xor`) |\")\nrep(\"`indexed`: `r[order[i]] = data[i]` (not in lib yet);\",\"`indexed`: `r[order[i]] = data[i]` (`permutation_candidates`);\")\nrep(\"| 63 | Mixed-day Mastery bundle | seen D15-D17 |\",\"| 63 | Mixed-day Mastery bundle | seen D15-D18 |\")\nnewrows=\"\"\"| 70 | Rolling / position-keyed XOR string decryptor (`b ^ k ^ i`, `k + i`, key array cycled, previous-byte chaining, LCG keystream) | gap (D18 TT `decryptByte`) | puzzle `data` or dex byte arrays under a per-index key | method taking `(B, I)`/`(I)` returning `B`/`C`, `xor-int`, `add-int/lit8` on the loop index, `rem-int` by key length | `jadx` the helper; py: solve the params from `ANS-` known plaintext, then decrypt | high: next step after D18's single-byte xor |\n| 71 | Known open-source string obfuscators (StringFog, Paranoid, obfuscapk EncryptStrings, Allatori-style) | gap | encrypted literal + library decrypt call | `com/github/megatronking/stringfog`, `StringFog.decrypt`, `io/michaelrocks/paranoid`, `Deobfuscator$`, obfuscapk `DecryptString`, AES-ECB with a fixed key | `jadx`; py re-implementation of the known algorithm | med-high |\n| 72 | Opaque predicates / dead-branch decoys | gap | the `ANS-` value on the reachable branch only | `if` on `x*(x+1) % 2`, constant-folded comparisons, unreachable `const-string ANS-` | `jadx` + reason about the predicate; `dex_eval_scan` executes the real path | med-high: pairs with D17 decoys |\n| 73 | Java serialized object / Parcel blob in assets | gap | `TC_STRING` fields inside `AC ED 00 05` stream | asset magic `aced0005`, `ObjectInputStream`, `readObject`, `Parcel.unmars